# The file header in src/remotedesktop.c names Red Hat as the copyright holder.
# Apply inside a clean official 46.2 tree with: patch -p1 < this file
# This is a private owned-VM experiment. It does not replace /usr/libexec and
# it is not stock production support. Upstream commit a4f6ed64474ff6fe6c4eb9dbe092d97cafd6ea81
# and xdg-desktop-portal-gnome MR !231 do not clear a consumed RemoteDesktop Start invocation.
# Ubuntu bug 2125128 tracks a screencast use-after-free and is not this RemoteDesktop fix.

